{"page":20250,"part":1,"text":"○势第四\n\n趯须蹲锋，得势而出，出则暗收。又云：前画卷则别敛心而出之。口诀云：傍锋轻揭借势，势不劲、笔不挫则意不深。与挑一也，锋贵于涩出，涩出期于倒收，所谓欲提还置也。夫自弩出，潜锋轻挫，借势而之。\n\n问曰：凡字之出，锋谓之挑，今更为，何也？论曰：挑者，语其小异而其体一也。夫者，笔锋去而言之，\n\n自弩笔下，杀笔起是也。法须挫衄，转笔出锋，伫思消息，则神踪不坠矣。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20250,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"6f0f7ef71491fd412d5fd1212890a82508b6f9003b663279d1d625979acd61ad","textSha256":"6f0f7ef71491fd412d5fd1212890a82508b6f9003b663279d1d625979acd61ad","fileSha256":"6f0f7ef71491fd412d5fd1212890a82508b6f9003b663279d1d625979acd61ad","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20250-wolai-5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"永字八法 · ○势第四","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":4,"sourceTextSha256":"64159183b4d8255bede04f710633edb3e2b1968e21c019e60471adcf28daabec","id":"2di7H78RezViTuKsjGQm5v","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"subHeader","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":4},{"start":6,"end":99,"sourceTextSha256":"39dd53f9313cf1638c93af2c942f0fb56a5722b42b5221ef5f4f90bb974e4b2a","id":"wWpiuDjgbfSXwL74kYPu1B","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":93},{"start":101,"end":147,"sourceTextSha256":"7936a54ef544540eedb65c194fc0d86ae75391b6a5a51aefec5950361d62dbf2","id":"95rfKYnEzyV7WY5DDmaAPv","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":46},{"start":149,"end":182,"sourceTextSha256":"c2d21972e10901089c75b1c7e337a0ccdd4428a01f79bc127bbfff4631b9e42d","id":"kAz